# GNSS Positioning

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:sidereon, "~> 2.0"}
])
```

## Load a precise ephemeris

A precise SP3 product (from an IGS or MGEX analysis center) gives each
satellite's position and clock on a fixed time grid. Here it is embedded as a
string so this notebook runs offline; in practice you would download one from a
public archive and load it with `Sidereon.GNSS.SP3.load/1`. This trimmed product
holds six GPS satellites on 2020-06-24.

```elixir
